# Two exports for the mutation gate's "a refused load writes nothing" pin:
# gv_free/1 is a CLAUSE-FREE vocabulary declaration (an importer may
# legitimately implement it), gv_owned/1 has a clause of its own (an importer
# may not).  gate_rival.clausal defines clauses for both, in that order, so a
# refusal that fired inside the write loop would already have written gv_free.
-module(gate_vocab, [gv_free/1, gv_owned(NAME)])
-private([red])

gv_owned(red),
